<title>SWITZERLAND: SOCCER-UEFA CUP THIRD ROUND DRAW.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-UEFA CUP THIRD ROUND DRAW.</headline>
<dateline>GENEVA 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Draw for the third round of the</p>
<p>UEFA Cup made on Friday:</p>
<p>Monaco (France) v Hamburg (Germany)</p>
<p>Brondby (Denmark) v Karlsruhe (Germany)</p>
<p>Tenerife (Spain) v Feyenoord (Netherlands)</p>
<p>Anderlecht (Belgium) v Helsingborg (Sweden)</p>
<p>Metz (France) v Newcastle United (England)</p>
<p>Club Brugge (Belgium) v Schalke (Germany)</p>
<p>Internazionale (Italy) v Boavista (Portugal)</p>
<p>Valencia (Spain) v Besiktas (Turkey)</p>
<p>First leg matches November 19, second leg December 3.</p>
</text>
